    {
      "id": "r20261103-a01",
      "title": "Nadia's First Flight",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Nadia is eight years old. Last month, she flew on an airplane for the first time. She went with her parents to visit her grandma in Makassar.",
        "At the airport, Nadia watched the big planes through the window. On the plane, a kind flight attendant gave her juice and cookies. Nadia sat next to the window and looked at the clouds below her.",
        "When the plane landed, Nadia clapped her hands. 'That was amazing!' she said. Grandma was waiting at the airport with a big smile and a bag of Nadia's favorite snacks."
      ],
